rt, this is \u00a31.10. There's a good few portions in that one. A loaf of wholemeal, 65p. Yes! We've got more than 10 items and we were under \u00a310. So we've got 12 items. We've got some tins, yoghurt, some veg, nice loaf of bread, pasta, rice, tea bags, chickpeas and biscuits for a little treat. \u00a39.35, 12 items. What a result!", "is_relevant": false}, {"shortCode": "Dcff3brsYFE", "url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/Dcff3brsYFE/", "caption": "STOP throwing all your dirty holiday clothes back into your suitcase! \u270b\ud83e\uddf3\n\nThis little packing cube trick makes coming home SO much easier \ud83d\ude4c\n\nBefore we leave, I use my packing cubes to sort all the dirty laundry into washing loads whites, darks, mixed colours and delicates.\n\nThen when I get home there\u2019s no huge suitcase of washing to sort through. Just unzip, empty and get those loads straight on! \ud83e\uddfa\u2728\n\nSuch a simple little holiday hack, but one that saves time when you\u2019re already dealing with the post-holiday chaos!\n\nDo you do this already, or are you stealing this one? \ud83d\udc40\n\n#travelhack #unpacking #packingcubes", "timestamp": "2026-08-26T05:49:06.000Z", "videoDuration": 11.866667, "videoPlayCount": 69755, "videoViewCount": null, "likesCount": -1, "commentsCount": 45, "displayUrl": "https://scontent-mad1-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/787135728_18620744992051176_479347818009133150_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_cat=100&ig_cache_key=Mzk3MjAzMzU0NTEwMTIxNDAyMDE4NjIwNzQ0OTg2MDUxMTc2.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6IkNMSVBTLnhwaWRzLjEyMTUuc2RyLnZpZGVvX2RlZmF1bHRfY292ZXJfZnJhbWUuQzMifQ%3D%3D&_nc_ohc=dRElCSOaQvkQ7kNvwE7lpej&_nc_oc=AdqRtOI6A-7JEFWrvX0t7ier4gakt3VYbD2n-p2lcafhcj1d4Cwo1bwuJqvXQP3ga9A&_nc_ad=z-m&_nc_cid=0&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-mad1-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=U8zjilg0RgMWleXwltn7zg&_nc_ss=7a22e&oh=00_AQLGmT5Rs1P4qmRyfohLuiJJfwGKkB8P20Euslz0LnMykg&oe=6A9A0511", "videoUrl": "https://scontent-ams2-1.cdninstagram.com/