uQ0xJUFMuQzMuNzIwLmRhc2hfYmFzZWxpbmVfMV92MSIsInhwdl9hc3NldF9pZCI6OTAxMjU2ODYyNjQ4NzAwLCJhc3NldF9hZ2VfZGF5cyI6MTAsInZpX3VzZWNhc2VfaWQiOjEwMDk5LCJkdXJhdGlvbl9zIjo2MywidXJsZ2VuX3NvdXJjZSI6Ind3dyJ9&ccb=17-1&vs=461f08e861dbb52a&_nc__d0vGp--cYEmRhc2hfYmFzZWxpbmVfMV92MREAdf4HZeadAQA&_nc_gid=nmOaMQOHv1I2-90gc67c7g&_nc_zt=28&_nc_ss=7a22e&oh=00_AQIJfI31W-o3GWjwGGfLrlwQ5bDUq2mYa92F67hOO_RphA&oe=6A9619AD", "musicInfo": {"artist_name": "lynsey_queenofclean", "song_name": "Original audio", "uses_original_audio": true, "should_mute_audio": false, "should_mute_audio_reason": "", "audio_id": "38848878031378244"}, "ownerUsername": "lynsey_queenofclean", "ownerFullName": "Lynsey Queen Of Clean", "history": [{"date": "2026-08-23", "plays": 70487, "likes": -1, "comments": 29}, {"date": "2026-08-30", "plays": 78055, "likes": -1, "comments": 30}], "still_climbing": false, "transcript": "Today's question I've had in is my tea towels, they smell clean but they've got a bit of a musty odour. Now most people, let's be honest and hold our hands up, even I can do this, are a tea towel abuser. So your poor little tea towel doesn't just dry dishes, it does so much more. So how do we keep it clean? When it comes to tea towels, you know what, I love a good old school like terry towel tea towel. They're so much better at soaking up those soapy suds. So if your tea towel's got any stains on it, I would grab some white vinegar and just liberally spray all of those stains like ketchup stains, food stains. Tea towels are just quite stainy, aren't they? So liberally spray with white vinegar, leave it for 15 minutes before washing. We're going to ditch the fabric conditioner because that takes away the absorbency. And for keeping it nice and white and bright, if you've got white tea towels, you're going to add in a nice big scoop of bicarbonate of soda. So they've actually run out in here, which is a real shame, but I would then add a laundry cleanser to the wash. It's just going to give them that extra boost, kill that bacteria and keep your tea towels looking as good as new.", "is_relevant": true, "hook_type": "Education", "videoViewCount": null}, {"shortCode": "DcOcZ0msB-H", "url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DcOcZ0msB-H/", "caption": "AD - WHY DID I NOT HAVE THIS BEFORE?!\n\nA butter dish that actually makes life a little easier! \ud83d\udc4f\n\nThis clever little gadget stores your butter, keeps it covered AND has a built-in slicer so you can get the perfect amount without wrestling with a cold block of butter. \n\n\u2728 Keeps butter neatly stored\n\u2728 Built-in cutter for easy slicing\n\u2728 Fits in the fridge\n\u2728 Keeps everything contained & mess-free\n\u2728 Also works for cheese!\n\nOne of those simple little kitchen gadgets you didn\u2019t know you needed\u2026 until you have one! \ud83e\uddc8\n\nI love a product that makes an everyday job just that little bit easier!\n\n#KitchenFinds #AmazonFinds #KitchenGadgets #AmazonUK #HomeFind", "timestamp": "2026-08-19T14:53:23.000Z", "videoDuration": 13.675102, "videoPlayCount": 2593, "likesCount": 18, "commentsCount": 0, "displayUrl": "https://instagram.fktw6-1.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t51.71878-15/780910523_3671960096290217_3881979341473446861_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpegr_e15_tt6&_nc_cat=102&ig_cache_key=Mzk2NzIzMzI0MTUzMjg2NjQzOQ%3D%3D.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6IkNMSVBTLnhwaWRzLjY0MC5oZHIudmlkZW9fZGVmYXVsdF9jb3Zlcl9mcmFtZS5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=_L8A_S0Yj2wQ7kNvwHzngLT&_nc_oc=AdqF8mydupUqkkME2gKit6XFOkvd-sNF5d6oo7otGmYo-NbiFXrclBYS3L8wbW3PsDc&_nc_ad=z-m&_nc_cid=0&_nc_zt=23&se=-1&_nc_ht=instagram.fktw6-1.fna&_nc_gid=mb5j0ZtJhlxajfHnTRS3iA&_nc_ss=7a22e&oh=00_AQIoKSj9lPl2X_1PeFvSc9hbYrlRPQDQWH2Nrd8Agelb6Q&oe=6A9A2251", "videoUrl": "https://instagram.fktw6-1.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m86/AQNGXXvDRddulY3UjnyRI0KbTKR6qIWfRcM66hMLfuLehb5gUvvdxW8tilPMm5VJSP-Dt2GPIBQU6vVqfObhHLx1CuwM_r0-TXIKqwI.mp4?_nc_cat=106&_nc_oc=AdpOUPB8FOSvdIwf9dUii8FawxfLYZIl9fQbmmV8e9wHEFRSu0fylDgzFUprLvwCmt0&_nc_sid=5e9851&_nc_ht=inst